        "Content": "<ul><li>Striking architect designed Mews</li><li>Recently refurbished and remodelled to include a new kitchen by Michael Farrell Kitchens, flooring and bathrooms</li><li>Tastefully presented contemporary accommodation</li><li>Feature sunken living and gallery landing with feature steel balustrade</li><li>L shaped room ideal for fully self-contained home office</li><li>Gas fired central heating. </li><li>West-facing low-maintenance rear garden. </li><li>Superbly convenient location only a short walk to St. Stephen's Green. </li><li>On-street parking and two resident's permits for Dartmouth Road. </li><li>Floor area approximately 189 sqm (2,034 sqft.) to include the attic. </li><li>First floor construction in concrete giving solidity and acoustic properties.</ul>"
